Kahan se kahan (the switch, short)

Pehle: ek reference store (Peri Beauty) hand-build kiya — poori homepage (announcement, header, hero, featured categories, deals, why-us, testimonials, cta-band, footer, product-card) + PDP, sab approved. Phir ek token engine banaya: ek chassis + component library + 5 token sets (Inter, Poppins, Montserrat, Outfit, Manrope) jo color, font, radius, shadow badalte hain. Token-loader settings.design_token padh ke apply karta hai. Ye render-verify bhi hua (Manrope flat/0px vs Poppins rounded/shadow).

The switch: token engine kaam karta hai, par uski ceiling thematic hai — woh sirf recolor/restyle karta hai, structure kabhi nahi badalta. Isliye do generated variants (Manrope vs Poppins) same store lage, sirf alag paint. Umang ne sahi bola: ye generic hai, do merchant ke store alag nahi dikhenge.

Ab: ek structural section-variant library — har section ke 5-6 layout-level alag variants. Store generation in variants ko assemble karega; token engine uske upar ki polish layer hai, replacement nahi. Structural = "alag store"; token = "alag paint".

